(5457473, 785907, 102394, '<td valign="top">I like that the perspective on this almost makes the branches look like trees in and of themselves.  The light coming through is also neat.  I understand why you left the trunk in the photo - it''s what establishes the view.  I think that some may see it as distracting.  Nice job!</td>', 'I like that the perspective on this almost makes the branches look like trees in and of themselves.  The light coming through is also neat.  I understand why you left the trunk in the photo - it''s what establishes the view.  I think that some may see it as distracting.  Nice job!', '2009-04-29 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457476, 785720, 102394, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this.  The lens flare and reflections are awesome.  Great job.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this.  The lens flare and reflections are awesome.  Great job.', '2009-04-29 14:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457478, 786012, 105672, '<td valign="top">nice photo, too much frame i think, and i would know im an offender of too much frame.</td>', 'nice photo, too much frame i think, and i would know im an offender of too much frame.', '2009-04-29 14:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
