(5457483, 785895, 102394, '<td valign="top">I think this would have more impact if there was at least one full tree, unobstructed, that was completely in focus.  I like the shot a lot, but having just a part of the first tree in the frame being the only thing in focus takes away from it.  Still a nice shot.</td>', 'I think this would have more impact if there was at least one full tree, unobstructed, that was completely in focus.  I like the shot a lot, but having just a part of the first tree in the frame being the only thing in focus takes away from it.  Still a nice shot.', '2009-04-29 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457486, 786133, 105672, '<td valign="top">nice shot, not crazy about the frame but its not horrible... 7</td>', 'nice shot, not crazy about the frame but its not horrible... 7', '2009-04-29 14:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457488, 786039, 102394, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  You captured that deep woods light filtering down through the leaves.  The perspective of the rows of trunks becomes a focal point, the light and shadow are a great backdrop for it.  Nice!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  You captured that deep woods light filtering down through the leaves.  The perspective of the rows of trunks becomes a focal point, the light and shadow are a great backdrop for it.  Nice!', '2009-04-29 14:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
