(5457708, 785308, 105113, '<td valign="top">By just capturing the base of the tree instead of the entire tree, you have focused the viewer. Good use of depth of field. I like it - 10</td>', 'By just capturing the base of the tree instead of the entire tree, you have focused the viewer. Good use of depth of field. I like it - 10', '2009-04-29 15:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457711, 786253, 105113, '<td valign="top">These are very beautiful tree bases. I like that there are several and wish that I could see more - 10.</td>', 'These are very beautiful tree bases. I like that there are several and wish that I could see more - 10.', '2009-04-29 15:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457713, 785830, 105113, '<td valign="top">My favorite. Very creative/unique. Should win the blue. What is the smoke like appearance above the nose? 10</td>', 'My favorite. Very creative/unique. Should win the blue. What is the smoke like appearance above the nose? 10', '2009-04-29 16:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457714, 785249, 105113, '<td valign="top">I love the coloring and noise in this picture - 10.</td>', 'I love the coloring and noise in this picture - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457715, 785693, 105113, '<td valign="top">I love taking pictures of tree roots - just my pictures don''t turn out this well. Love the conversion to black and white for clarity - 10.</td>', 'I love taking pictures of tree roots - just my pictures don''t turn out this well. Love the conversion to black and white for clarity - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457716, 786056, 105113, '<td valign="top">Great contrasting images. Well done - 10</td>', 'Great contrasting images. Well done - 10', '2009-04-29 16:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457717, 784873, 105113, '<td valign="top">Love the conversion to black and white. I was going to post a picture of an old school building as an example of what trees become but wasn''t sure that it would meet the challenge definition. I''ll let the SC decide about this, but I love the picture - 10.</td>', 'Love the conversion to black and white. I was going to post a picture of an old school building as an example of what trees become but wasn''t sure that it would meet the challenge definition. I''ll let the SC decide about this, but I love the picture - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457721, 786037, 105113, '<td valign="top">I was thinking that there would be a lot of examples in this challenge of trees from this angle - and I was right. But the colors and subtlety of this picture is beautiful - 10.</td>', 'I was thinking that there would be a lot of examples in this challenge of trees from this angle - and I was right. But the colors and subtlety of this picture is beautiful - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457723, 785944, 105113, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the way every bit of the picture adds to the photograph - 10.</td>', 'I love the colors and the way every bit of the picture adds to the photograph - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457724, 786179, 105113, '<td valign="top">Great example of contrast. Beautifully executed. 10</td>', 'Great example of contrast. Beautifully executed. 10', '2009-04-29 16:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457727, 785908, 105113, '<td valign="top">The sky is a bit overwhelming for this to be a picture about the tree. The tree appears to be coincidental in this shot. But regardless, beautiful picture - 10.</td>', 'The sky is a bit overwhelming for this to be a picture about the tree. The tree appears to be coincidental in this shot. But regardless, beautiful picture - 10.', '2009-04-29 16:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457729, 785048, 105113, '<td valign="top">I was just a little confused about where I am - am I under a bridge?? Regardless, beautiful colors and love the softness - 10</td>', 'I was just a little confused about where I am - am I under a bridge?? Regardless, beautiful colors and love the softness - 10', '2009-04-29 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457731, 785342, 105113, '<td valign="top">Ribbon contender! Very unique picture. First thought was where is the tree? but once I found them, I loved the picture. 10</td>', 'Ribbon contender! Very unique picture. First thought was where is the tree? but once I found them, I loved the picture. 10', '2009-04-29 16:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457735, 785701, 105113, '<td valign="top">Gets a ten from me. Beautiful colors and very soft lighting is appealing. If I was to be nit-picky, i would say that the bird, IMO is distracting and that the picture would be cleaner without it. I still love it.</td>', 'Gets a ten from me. Beautiful colors and very soft lighting is appealing. If I was to be nit-picky, i would say that the bird, IMO is distracting and that the picture would be cleaner without it. I still love it.', '2009-04-29 16:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457736, 786051, 105113, '<td valign="top">Very sharp, crisp image. The dark skies, which feel threatening, are needed to capture the details of the tree. 10</td>', 'Very sharp, crisp image. The dark skies, which feel threatening, are needed to capture the details of the tree. 10', '2009-04-29 16:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5457799, 785908, 63499, '<td valign="top">I wish the trees took up a little more of the photo, but I like this. And wow, I love the details that you captured in the sky.</td>', 'I wish the trees took up a little more of the photo, but I like this. And wow, I love the details that you captured in the sky.', '2009-04-29 16:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
