(5458715, 786126, 70128, '<td valign="top">ok, and where''s Heidi? very nice scenery! somewhere in the british isles maybe?</td>', 'ok, and where''s Heidi? very nice scenery! somewhere in the british isles maybe?', '2009-04-30 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458722, 785160, 96755, '<td valign="top">My first reaction when this loaded was..."This is a great photo".  Well done.</td>', 'My first reaction when this loaded was..."This is a great photo".  Well done.', '2009-04-30 12:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458750, 785342, 9462, '<td valign="top">What an odd orchard. This would''ve also been a good entry into the "*Green" challenge since that is quite a clever way to reuse old tires, it might''ve even placed higher there since there''s so few entries. <br/>I really like how muted the tons are, especially since a desert scene is one that is typically very bright. It does appear to be unlevel but I have a feeling that''s just an illusion created by the darker trees in the background on the right and the extreme wide angle.<br/> <br/>I will definitely be coming back to this one.</td>', 'What an odd orchard. This would''ve also been a good entry into the "*Green" challenge since that is quite a clever way to reuse old tires, it might''ve even placed higher there since there''s so few entries. I really like how muted the tons are, especially since a desert scene is one that is typically very bright. It does appear to be unlevel but I have a feeling that''s just an illusion created by the darker trees in the background on the right and the extreme wide angle. I will definitely be coming back to this one.', '2009-04-30 12:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458782, 784907, 96755, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Focus appears more on the hut then the trees around it.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Focus appears more on the hut then the trees around it.', '2009-04-30 12:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5458786, 785377, 70128, '<td valign="top">i love bonsais!</td>', 'i love bonsais!', '2009-04-30 12:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
