(5459030, 786257, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - Beautiful light, colors, angle, DOF....just everything. 10.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - Beautiful light, colors, angle, DOF....just everything. 10.', '2009-04-30 16:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459032, 785942, 63499, '<td valign="top">I like your use of light here. The dark gray sky really makes the tree stand out.</td>', 'I like your use of light here. The dark gray sky really makes the tree stand out.', '2009-04-30 16:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459035, 785665, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - Nice use of b&amp;w for this. I like the contrasts, textures and DOF on this.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - Nice use of b&w for this. I like the contrasts, textures and DOF on this.', '2009-04-30 16:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459047, 785574, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - Gorgeous colors and lighting. I like that the reflections are nice and clear and nice touch having the boaters in the photo. Bumping this up to a 10.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - Gorgeous colors and lighting. I like that the reflections are nice and clear and nice touch having the boaters in the photo. Bumping this up to a 10.', '2009-04-30 16:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459050, 786216, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - Nice and simple and very well done.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - Nice and simple and very well done.', '2009-04-30 16:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459063, 785683, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - nice colors, exposure and I like that you captured lots of details in the sky instead of blowing it out. But, to me, there seems to be too much going on in this photo. The road is leading me through the photo, but I want to go back and look at things that I''m missing - i.e., it''s not a nice easy transition through the photo.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - nice colors, exposure and I like that you captured lots of details in the sky instead of blowing it out. But, to me, there seems to be too much going on in this photo. The road is leading me through the photo, but I want to go back and look at things that I''m missing - i.e., it''s not a nice easy transition through the photo.', '2009-04-30 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459064, 786002, 93283, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot, 9</td>', 'Amazing shot, 9', '2009-04-30 16:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459065, 784771, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love how simple this shot is. Well done</td>', 'I love how simple this shot is. Well done', '2009-04-30 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459066, 785246, 93283, '<td valign="top">Normally, I''m not big on abstract photos, usually because the person was reaching for something or just playing with the camera settings, but this is a great shot. It is an abstract shot, but conveys the challenge theme and at the same time, appears well constructed and thought out. Very well done, 8</td>', 'Normally, I''m not big on abstract photos, usually because the person was reaching for something or just playing with the camera settings, but this is a great shot. It is an abstract shot, but conveys the challenge theme and at the same time, appears well constructed and thought out. Very well done, 8', '2009-04-30 16:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459067, 786259, 93283, '<td valign="top">I love the way the light casts through the trees. Nice Shot!</td>', 'I love the way the light casts through the trees. Nice Shot!', '2009-04-30 16:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459068, 785068, 93283, '<td valign="top">The stillness of this shot is awesome. Great capture...</td>', 'The stillness of this shot is awesome. Great capture...', '2009-04-30 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459069, 785151, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very unique and surreal shot. Well done!</td>', 'Very unique and surreal shot. Well done!', '2009-04-30 16:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459071, 785574, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, good shot</td>', 'Very nice scene, good shot', '2009-04-30 16:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459144, 786277, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette, lovely sky, particularly like how grey-blue clouds at top balance grey-blue sea at bottom.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette, lovely sky, particularly like how grey-blue clouds at top balance grey-blue sea at bottom.', '2009-04-30 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459146, 786284, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait, extremely intimate and romantic, very Cartier-Bresson but perhaps even better.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait, extremely intimate and romantic, very Cartier-Bresson but perhaps even better.', '2009-04-30 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459151, 785081, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice stufy of root and lower trunk detail. Liking the lichen/ moss.</td>', 'Nice stufy of root and lower trunk detail. Liking the lichen/ moss.', '2009-04-30 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459153, 785851, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene, that''s very dramatic.Nice use of framing and contrasting subjects.</td>', 'Wow, what a scene, that''s very dramatic.Nice use of framing and contrasting subjects.', '2009-04-30 17:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459154, 786012, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the mingling of manmade, modern architecture and organic tree silhouette. Nice colours too.</td>', 'Like the mingling of manmade, modern architecture and organic tree silhouette. Nice colours too.', '2009-04-30 17:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459155, 785001, 3087, '<td valign="top">Liking this abstract.</td>', 'Liking this abstract.', '2009-04-30 17:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459157, 786229, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the scene but the colours are just too pumped for me, and I like highly saturated images.</td>', 'Like the scene but the colours are just too pumped for me, and I like highly saturated images.', '2009-04-30 17:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459161, 785678, 3087, '<td valign="top">Funky! I like the selective desat and the blurry portions (I never know whether that means lens baby or Holga or something else, and frankly, I''m not that bothered, it''s the results that count!).</td>', 'Funky! I like the selective desat and the blurry portions (I never know whether that means lens baby or Holga or something else, and frankly, I''m not that bothered, it''s the results that count!).', '2009-04-30 17:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459166, 785701, 3087, '<td valign="top">Serenity. The beauty of nature. The freedom of flight. The light of the sun. Life-giving water suspended in the mist. Magic.</td>', 'Serenity. The beauty of nature. The freedom of flight. The light of the sun. Life-giving water suspended in the mist. Magic.', '2009-04-30 17:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459168, 786119, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of the stand for framing. Lovely bonsai.</td>', 'Great use of the stand for framing. Lovely bonsai.', '2009-04-30 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459171, 784554, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the use of local lighting (flash?) to show us this one broken tree and the darkness beyond. Colours of the sky very pretty.</td>', 'Like the use of local lighting (flash?) to show us this one broken tree and the darkness beyond. Colours of the sky very pretty.', '2009-04-30 17:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459173, 785822, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract, really like this very much.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract, really like this very much.', '2009-04-30 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459174, 786066, 3087, '<td valign="top">Unusual both in content and composition. Works well, for me. Quirky.</td>', 'Unusual both in content and composition. Works well, for me. Quirky.', '2009-04-30 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459175, 786216, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.', '2009-04-30 17:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459176, 786037, 3087, '<td valign="top">Loving the backlit leaves, they look like magic confetti just hanging on those boughs above. Lovely composition, lovely light.</td>', 'Loving the backlit leaves, they look like magic confetti just hanging on those boughs above. Lovely composition, lovely light.', '2009-04-30 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459178, 785942, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice light, and lovely colours of the stormy sky against the rich yellow greens of the tree and grass.</td>', 'Nice light, and lovely colours of the stormy sky against the rich yellow greens of the tree and grass.', '2009-04-30 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459179, 785709, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail though that thing upon it is distracting to me.</td>', 'Beautiful detail though that thing upon it is distracting to me.', '2009-04-30 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459182, 785496, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast between nature and building plus the lovely shadow, so much lower than it''s subject.</td>', 'Like the contrast between nature and building plus the lovely shadow, so much lower than it''s subject.', '2009-04-30 17:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
