(5459440, 784685, 105113, '<td valign="top">Strange effect. I like it and wish I knew how you achieved it. Had to go back and give this picture a higher score after looking at it more. 9</td>', 'Strange effect. I like it and wish I knew how you achieved it. Had to go back and give this picture a higher score after looking at it more. 9', '2009-04-30 18:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
