(5459718, 786212, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it except for the yellow component in the grass and shrubs being too strong for my personal preference.</td>', 'I like it except for the yellow component in the grass and shrubs being too strong for my personal preference.', '2009-04-30 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
