(5459724, 786122, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me a touch dim, but otherwise a nice scene. I wonder if you''d tweaked it to enhance the details of the bark and rock, how that might look. Might make a nice b/w.</td>', 'Comes off to me a touch dim, but otherwise a nice scene. I wonder if you''d tweaked it to enhance the details of the bark and rock, how that might look. Might make a nice b/w.', '2009-04-30 22:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459727, 785830, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought my own entry was doing well, but I expect this to trounce mine by a <b>WIDE</b> margin. Lots of effort, creativity and just some damn good photography. I am humbled. A 10 and a fave.</td>', 'I thought my own entry was doing well, but I expect this to trounce mine by a WIDE margin. Lots of effort, creativity and just some damn good photography. I am humbled. A 10 and a fave.', '2009-04-30 22:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459741, 786279, 63499, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment - Nice sunflare and the trees have lots of character with their twisty branches. The exposure, composition and depth of focus look great. Overall though, I feel that this seems to be lacking something - more contrast? a little bit of a saturation boost? something else? I''m just not sure exactly.</td>', 'Coming back to comment - Nice sunflare and the trees have lots of character with their twisty branches. The exposure, composition and depth of focus look great. Overall though, I feel that this seems to be lacking something - more contrast? a little bit of a saturation boost? something else? I''m just not sure exactly.', '2009-04-30 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459746, 784872, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting yet, but I liked the thumbnail, and I like the shot!</td>', 'I''m not voting yet, but I liked the thumbnail, and I like the shot!', '2009-04-30 23:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5459749, 786253, 103142, '<td valign="top">very, very nice</td>', 'very, very nice', '2009-04-30 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
