(5465842, 786114, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very true title. I like the perspective and composition here, and it''s got great detail on the building. Looks like a bit of a wider lens was used than the 18mm kit lens I have.<br/> <br/>I''m going to hazard a guess, based on the subject and style, that this may be a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> entry.</td>', 'Very true title. I like the perspective and composition here, and it''s got great detail on the building. Looks like a bit of a wider lens was used than the 18mm kit lens I have. I''m going to hazard a guess, based on the subject and style, that this may be a  Melethia entry.', '2009-05-03 17:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
