(5465999, 786240, 18705, '<td valign="top">There''s a lovely feel to this shot. It''s just a shame that the horse is so central in the frame.</td>', 'There''s a lovely feel to this shot. It''s just a shame that the horse is so central in the frame.', '2009-05-03 18:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466014, 785249, 18705, '<td valign="top">Lovely feel to this shot. Would have liked to see the whole tree in the frame though.</td>', 'Lovely feel to this shot. Would have liked to see the whole tree in the frame though.', '2009-05-03 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466035, 785851, 106233, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and composition! Ribbon favourite!</td>', 'Beautiful light and composition! Ribbon favourite!', '2009-05-03 18:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466061, 786062, 83313, '<td valign="top">On interesting approach. Comes off to me a little bright and washed out.</td>', 'On interesting approach. Comes off to me a little bright and washed out.', '2009-05-03 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466080, 784601, 83313, '<td valign="top">An nice perspective view, but needs some serious adjustments to bump it up visually. I played with some adjustments to this one and it really has some potential. I got something pretty neat looking by running it through topaz adjust.<br/> <br/>One other thing is that you should use the maximum allowed image size in at least one direction in order to maximize visible detail.</td>', 'An nice perspective view, but needs some serious adjustments to bump it up visually. I played with some adjustments to this one and it really has some potential. I got something pretty neat looking by running it through topaz adjust. One other thing is that you should use the maximum allowed image size in at least one direction in order to maximize visible detail.', '2009-05-03 19:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466082, 784741, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good variation of a cliche shot. Hey, my own entry is extremely cliche, so that''s not a ding against it!</td>', 'A good variation of a cliche shot. Hey, my own entry is extremely cliche, so that''s not a ding against it!', '2009-05-03 19:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466188, 786200, 31637, '<td valign="top">Great use of your lens, perfectly executed framing. It is a nice shot, lacking a bit of wow factor.</td>', 'Great use of your lens, perfectly executed framing. It is a nice shot, lacking a bit of wow factor.', '2009-05-03 20:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466189, 786241, 31637, '<td valign="top">Super shot, similair to my outtake, I appreciate the composition, fills frame and gradient fill works wonders for this particular shot.</td>', 'Super shot, similair to my outtake, I appreciate the composition, fills frame and gradient fill works wonders for this particular shot.', '2009-05-03 20:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5466190, 786222, 31637, '<td valign="top">Thanks again for this! Sky sure don''t look like that around here :( Im sure at one point it looked like that everywhere. Clever use of the trees btw, most would think this is deeper astrophotography without them.</td>', 'Thanks again for this! Sky sure don''t look like that around here :( Im sure at one point it looked like that everywhere. Clever use of the trees btw, most would think this is deeper astrophotography without them.', '2009-05-03 20:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
