(5467803, 785103, 102432, '<td valign="top">i think the rotation takes away from the shot... if it was upright and the crop was still offset, then it would be a better presentation. but i love the the lighting and and the serenity of the shot. good job!</td>', 'i think the rotation takes away from the shot... if it was upright and the crop was still offset, then it would be a better presentation. but i love the the lighting and and the serenity of the shot. good job!', '2009-05-04 12:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
