(5471819, 785830, 85950, '<td valign="top">thank you very much for all the comments and supporting votes. I was expecting a little bit more from this picture, but definitely I need to do much more work till I''ll create a really good image.<br/> <br/>Thanks a lot for all the comments and your support!</td>', 'thank you very much for all the comments and supporting votes. I was expecting a little bit more from this picture, but definitely I need to do much more work till I''ll create a really good image. Thanks a lot for all the comments and your support!', '2009-05-06 03:50:50.000000', NULL, 0),
