(5471874, 785717, 95634, '<td valign="top">Wow, that didn''t go too well.<br/> <br/>1) I realize the topic was trees, that''s why there are some in the background, and I tried to emphasize that flowers can look as tall or taller from a low perspective.<br/> <br/>2) Funny you should say the insect must be a bit "dislectic", since I assume you meant "dyslexic" haha. Oh the irony...</td>', 'Wow, that didn''t go too well. 1) I realize the topic was trees, that''s why there are some in the background, and I tried to emphasize that flowers can look as tall or taller from a low perspective. 2) Funny you should say the insect must be a bit "dislectic", since I assume you meant "dyslexic" haha. Oh the irony...', '2009-05-06 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
