(5472174, 786183, 91496, '<td valign="top">All those nice comments you write and you only get two.  Definately not fair.<br/> <br/>Love the tree with all the details, really a photo that you can look at for a while.  I think the composition either needs to pull back a little and get the tree on the thirds or crop in more and have the tree fill the frame.</td>', 'All those nice comments you write and you only get two.  Definately not fair. Love the tree with all the details, really a photo that you can look at for a while.  I think the composition either needs to pull back a little and get the tree on the thirds or crop in more and have the tree fill the frame.', '2009-05-06 09:22:51.000000', NULL, 0),
