(5472271, 785927, 3724, '<td valign="top">I think a good observation, crop shape feels awkward, and the frame dominating, but I like this.<br/>A conventional overlook view - but the light interesting here - city of Gwalior, as background, fading to a hazy, obscured horizon in the shadow of the unseen hill, with bright, full sun reflected from the tree. <br/></td>', 'I think a good observation, crop shape feels awkward, and the frame dominating, but I like this.A conventional overlook view - but the light interesting here - city of Gwalior, as background, fading to a hazy, obscured horizon in the shadow of the unseen hill, with bright, full sun reflected from the tree. ', '2009-05-06 10:13:37.000000', NULL, 0),
