(5472791, 786053, 73998, '<td valign="top">It does kind of look like HDR, doesn''t it?  Well, it''s just straight processing from a single RAW file.  In fact, I didn''t even use Fill Light or Shadows/Highlights tool.  I did, however, us a polarizer, which helped darken the sky a bit.</td>', 'It does kind of look like HDR, doesn''t it?  Well, it''s just straight processing from a single RAW file.  In fact, I didn''t even use Fill Light or Shadows/Highlights tool.  I did, however, us a polarizer, which helped darken the sky a bit.', '2009-05-06 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 0),
