(5487226, 784999, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am with the commentors here, Cropping out the tree on this has made it look unfinished.....<br/>Including that space would have then moved the tree closer to the correct line of third which is a strong place to have the subject, and therefore added to your composition here.<br/> <br/>Again, an addition of a little saturation in Post processing would help this a little.<br/>Not sure about the border.  Wouldn''t have included it.  I don''t think it needs framing like that.<br/> <br/>But......Did you consider this in Black and White.  Desat the entire image.......Fits with the Old Oak tree and looks quite effective as well.</td>', 'I am with the commentors here, Cropping out the tree on this has made it look unfinished.....Including that space would have then moved the tree closer to the correct line of third which is a strong place to have the subject, and therefore added to your composition here. Again, an addition of a little saturation in Post processing would help this a little.Not sure about the border.  Wouldn''t have included it.  I don''t think it needs framing like that. But......Did you consider this in Black and White.  Desat the entire image.......Fits with the Old Oak tree and looks quite effective as well.', '2009-05-15 01:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5487258, 785551, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity in this one.  It should have scored so much higher!</td>', 'I love the simplicity in this one.  It should have scored so much higher!', '2009-05-15 02:20:54.000000', NULL, 0),
