(5578911, 784771, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz on that well deserved red with this amazing shot. Browsed your portfolio whilst i was here and i must say i am impressed by much of your work. Some really diverse stuff in there and with varying styles and techniques.</td>', 'Congratz on that well deserved red with this amazing shot. Browsed your portfolio whilst i was here and i must say i am impressed by much of your work. Some really diverse stuff in there and with varying styles and techniques.', '2009-07-19 08:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
