(5889823, 785854, 101117, '<td valign="top">I was just scrolling through all your challenge entries to pick a couple out to comment on and stopped the second I saw this.<br/> <br/>I''ve walked down this very path a number of times looking for interesting things to photograph (I live literally 5 minutes walk from here on George St) and I have never come up with anything nearly as striking as this!<br/> <br/>The lights are obviously the first thing that catch my attention being the brightest area of the shot, but it''s the trees that really make it. I''m guessing you knew that judging by your title but I really felt I had to state it again!<br/> <br/>I particularly like that you have made what would usually be the main feature (the lights and path) as almost a footnote here!</td>', 'I was just scrolling through all your challenge entries to pick a couple out to comment on and stopped the second I saw this. I''ve walked down this very path a number of times looking for interesting things to photograph (I live literally 5 minutes walk from here on George St) and I have never come up with anything nearly as striking as this! The lights are obviously the first thing that catch my attention being the brightest area of the shot, but it''s the trees that really make it. I''m guessing you knew that judging by your title but I really felt I had to state it again! I particularly like that you have made what would usually be the main feature (the lights and path) as almost a footnote here!', '2010-03-04 05:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6071990, 786253, 98339, '<td valign="top">but I want to know where this is....it reminds me of the place that we stopped along the Natchez Trace in Mississippi...well done</td>', 'but I want to know where this is....it reminds me of the place that we stopped along the Natchez Trace in Mississippi...well done', '2010-06-28 11:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6108712, 784771, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images the "substance" people hate.  But that''s not what we''re going for here.  We''re going for the art of color and form.  You did a very good job, obviously, as reflected in the score.  If I were to tweak it, I would have cloned out the brush or tree or whatever that is at the bottom of the trunk.  This image is about simplicity and so detail like that is a downside, not an upside.  Composition is great and you did well in your sharpening.  I tend to oversharpen stuff like this and it usually looks worse.</td>', 'This is one of those images the "substance" people hate.  But that''s not what we''re going for here.  We''re going for the art of color and form.  You did a very good job, obviously, as reflected in the score.  If I were to tweak it, I would have cloned out the brush or tree or whatever that is at the bottom of the trunk.  This image is about simplicity and so detail like that is a downside, not an upside.  Composition is great and you did well in your sharpening.  I tend to oversharpen stuff like this and it usually looks worse.', '2010-07-29 16:10:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6137067, 785907, 106292, '<td valign="top">Are you trying to copy me?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=786210" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1027/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786210.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1027/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786210.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1027/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_786210.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Are you trying to copy me? ', '2010-08-21 20:17:03.000000', NULL, 0),
